CohenEngine -- use the original Macaulay2 LLL algorithm
*******************************************************

Description
===========

CohenEngine -- a strategy value for *note LLL(...,Strategy=>...):
LLL_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, used to specify that the all-integer
LLL algorithm from H.Cohen's book (with improvements by Euchner and Schnorr)
should be used.  This is basically the same algorithm as Strategy=>NTL, but is
often outperformed by that algorithm.

