CohenTopLevel -- use the Macaulay2 language LLL algorithm
*********************************************************

Description
===========

CohenTopLevel -- a strategy value for *note LLL(...,Strategy=>...):
LLL_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, used to specify that the all-integer
LLL algorithm from H.Cohen's book (with improvements by Euchner and Schnorr)
should be used, as coded in the front-end of Macaulay2. This is basically the
same algorithm as Strategy=>CohenEngine, but is written at top level, so that
it is relatively easy to adapt the code to other situations.

